---
/**
 * @category FAQ
 * @theme classic
 * @name FAQ
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-16 py-16'>
  <div class='w-full'>
    <h2
      class='text-5xl text-center text-stone-800 font-semibold tracking-[-2%] px-4'
    >
      Časté otázky
    </h2>
  </div>
  <div class='w-full px-4 mt-10'>
    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'
          >Jak začnu s tímto nástrojem pro weby v Astro?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          Začněte tím, že projekt nainstalujete v terminálu. Pak ho spusťte u sebe a web v Astro skládejte přetahováním hotových komponent.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'>Jak upravím svůj web v Astro?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          Web v Astro si snadno přizpůsobíte změnou textů a obrázků v hotových komponentách. Pro jemnější úpravy můžete sáhnout přímo do kódu. Díky tomu si stránky pekárny nastavíte přesně podle sebe.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'>Jak nasadím svůj web v Astro?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          Až web dokončíte, vyexportujte projekt a máte celý kód. Web v Astro pak snadno nasadíte třeba na Vercel nebo Netlify.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details
      class='border-t border-stone-200 group/item'
    >
      <summary
        class='flex justify-between items-center w-full py-5 cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300'
      >
        <span
          class='text-base font-semibold text-stone-800 group-hover/item:text-stone-600'
          >Jaké jsou licenční podmínky tohoto nástroje pro weby v Astro?</span
        >
        <span>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 group-open/item:hidden'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              d='M10.75 4.75C10.75 4.33579 10.4142 4 10 4C9.58579 4 9.25 4.33579 9.25 4.75V9.25H4.75C4.33579 9.25 4 9.58579 4 10C4 10.4142 4.33579 10.75 4.75 10.75L9.25 10.75V15.25C9.25 15.6642 9.58579 16 10 16C10.4142 16 10.75 15.6642 10.75 15.25V10.75L15.25 10.75C15.6642 10.75 16 10.4142 16 10C16 9.58579 15.6642 9.25 15.25 9.25H10.75V4.75Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <svg
            class='fill-stone-800 group-hover/item:fill-stone-600 h-6 w-6 transition-transform duration-200 hidden group-open/item:block'
            width='20'
            height='20'
            viewBox='0 0 20 20'
            fill='none'
            xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          >
            <path
              fill-rule='evenodd'
              clip-rule='evenodd'
              d='M4 10C4 9.58579 4.33579 9.25 4.75 9.25L15.25 9.25C15.6642 9.25 16 9.58579 16 10C16 10.4142 15.6642 10.75 15.25 10.75L4.75 10.75C4.33579 10.75 4 10.4142 4 10Z'
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class='pb-5'>
        <p
          class='text-base text-stone-500'
        >
          Tento nástroj pro tvorbu webů v Astro je pro osobní použití zdarma. Pro komerční provoz je nutné zakoupit licenci. Podrobnosti a ceny najdete na stránce s licencí.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
